The wolsheim@prls.UUCP (Evert Wolsheimer) writes:
-=> Last night I was running nethack 2.3e, got up to level 27, and was
-=> polymorphed into an invisible stalker (I). No problem, until I prayed (hoping
-=> to become human again). The computer (VAX) went bananas. My keyboard
-=> locked, and from a different terminal I could see that I was burning
-=> CPU time like crazy..... What happened??? Has anybody seen this before?

We 3.0 developers already fixed this one.  Your dungeon has THEOLOGY
defined, and the gods tried to cure your Confusion.  However,
Invisible stalkers and bats have intrinsic confusion.  The way the
switch is set up, it "cured" your confusion again, and again, and
again.  

The bug is in pray.c, where TROUBLE_CONFUSED is set when "Confusion"
is true, instead of "HConfusion".


